WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.260
During the competition with

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.290
the Dark Cooking Society,

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.370
the result is one win and one draw.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.270
At Round 3,

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.200
something unexpected happened.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.000
In this round,

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.590
Lei En's rival

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:44.670
is female chef Xiang En,

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.170
a leader in the Dark Cooking Society.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.080
She took out the same Seven-Star Knives

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.580
as Lei En.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.970
There is another set of

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.900
mysterious Seven-Star Knives in the world.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.250
How will the competition go on?

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Wake Up, Lei En

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.940
The Destiny of A Chef

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.280
Given the blade and light,

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:12.790
there is no doubt they're the Seven-Star Knives.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.270
But why do you have the knives too?

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:16.690
Isn't there one set of Seven-Star Knives

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.680
in the world?

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.300
How can you be so sure, Lei En?

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.490
That's because this set

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:26.570
was casted by Master Roger

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.660
for me.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.490
And Roger...

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.070
Roger...

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:34.250
Roger?

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.030
What's the matter with you, Lei En?

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.950
There's something wrong with him.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.760
If you can't tell the truth,

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.150
let me help you.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:45.940
Roger

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:47.410
was killed by you.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:51.780
So

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.220
there should be only one set.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.440
Is that what you want to say, Lei En?

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:57.720
Am I right?

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.920
Shut up.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:01.890
Like the mark on your left hand

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.480
that will never disappear,

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.770
the blood on your hands

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.180
will never be washed away.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:09.580
It won't wash out.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.060
Is Lei En's dreadful mistake...

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:16.300
I learned dark technology at that time

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.690
and became arrogant.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.230
So finally,

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.830
I committed an irreparable mistake.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.700
Liar. That must be a lie.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.750
Lei En wouldn't do anything like that.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:34.910
Lei En.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.810
Lei En.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:36.690
Mao.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.220
Lei En.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:42.930
Lei En.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.020
Lei En.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.380
Pull yourself together, Lei En.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.600
That's not true, is it?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.300
She must be mistaken, isn't she?

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.710
Lei En, come on, say she's a liar.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.660
Hey, what's the truth?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.010
Don't just stand there.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:54.990
Come on, make it clear.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.150
It is none of your business.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.190
What?

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.670
Then whatever.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.800
How is it none of our business?

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.670
From the beginning of this journey,

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.390
aren't we already

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.020
partners going through thick and thin?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.560
Say it out, Lei En.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.270
It's the biggest mistake

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:26.310
I've ever made.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:28.690
After joining

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.520
the Dark Cooking Society,

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.110
I practiced and improved my knife skills

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.150
that no one can beat me.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.440
But my desire

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.560
to be a top chef

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.700
still couldn't fulfilled.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.480
I want to be better.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.340
I always thought that only with the best knife,

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.820
could I fulfil the goal.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.740
So I went to visit

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.260
Maker of Knife Roger

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:56.350
and asked him to make a set of knives for me,

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.230
which are the famous knives,

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.470
the Seven-Star Knives.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.280
I finally got the perfect knives.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.410
I was very pleased

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.780
and thought

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.880
I could become a top chef.

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.860
But it was the beginning of my felony.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.910
With these perfect knives,

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.110
I will be able to surpass others

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.210
and reach the peak of perfection.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.540
Roger's craftsmanship really lives up to his reputation.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:24.640
It's not even close.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.860
For a knife maker,

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.150
this is not my most satisfying work.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.990
Next time I must make a better knife

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.830
than these Seven-Star Knives.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.260
There can never be a better knife

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:50.440
in the world.

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:03.010
This Seven-Star Knife is unrivalled

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.000
and perfect knife in the world.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.840
So I'll always be

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.160
an unmatchable chef.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.710
When I came to my senses,

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.450
all I saw was the Seven-Star Knife covered with blood

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.840
in my hand.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.780
I immediately felt great regret.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.580
Then I confessed my crime

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.560
to the Head of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.040
That's good, Lei En.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:35.090
In order to achieve the goal,

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:36.960
sometimes you just have to do whatever it takes.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.880
This is how the Dark Cooking Society works.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.820
That's when I first felt

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.660
the horror of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.600
No way. How could Lei En do that?

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:54.790
I can't believe a guy like Lei En

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.760
would do that.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.620
The Dark Cooking Society is so scary.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.110
I'm sorry. I can't hang in there.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.250
When it comes to the past,

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:07.510
you just completely

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:08.860
lost your will to fight.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.460
You can't compete with me.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.130
The result is already known.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.620
Lei En is the murderer.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.500
But if what Lei En told is the truth,

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.760
why do you also have the Seven-Star Knives?

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.380
The ghost of Roger

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.400
is still on the set of Seven-Star Knives.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.580
What the hell is going on?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.920
If you don't want to compete, just get your ass back.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.070
Yeah. If you refuse, go back.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.890
Come on.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.320
Lei En.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:39.260
Compete with her, Lei En.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.910
Lei En.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:42.960
I'm sorry.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.460
I have no way to compare now.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.500
Lei En.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.740
What's the hell going on?

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:50.680
He really quit.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:51.680
Come on.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.150
Lei En, I was wrong about you.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.750
No matter how much you blame yourself,

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.590
there's no way to undo that fact.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.690
Roger can't come back to life.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.040
The important thing is to bring down
the Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.210
That's why you

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:09.500
left there, didn't you?

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:10.630
Do you remember

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.090
what you said

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.440
when you met us?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.060
You said you were a man who abandoned the past.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.420
Have you forgotten it?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:20.620
How can you understand my feelings?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.070
I don't understand.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.430
But if you run away now,

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.960
you're not a real chef.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.350
If you think that

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.980
you brought tragic fate to Master Roger,

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.150
you should try hard to

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.450
bring happiness to more people.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.530
That's the right thing.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.420
Happiness.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:44.290
You can always

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.720
remind me of the original intention

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:47.580
of being a chef.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:53.880
Lei En.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.050
No matter what you said,

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.540
the crime you've committed

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.500
can't be erased.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:03.730
That's good.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:04.880
My sin

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.380
will drive me

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.830
to be

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.430
a good chef.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.610
What?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.280
Get out of the way.

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:16.600
Go ahead, judges.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.380
What kind of seafood do you want to eat?

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:19.960
As a chef,

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.640
I'll use food materials

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.410
to bring you happiness.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:24.530
Lei En.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:25.180
Lei En.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.840
So cool.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.660
Okay, I won't stand on ceremony.

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:30.220
When it comes to seafood in Shanghai,

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.730
the first dish that comes to mind is

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.180
Shanghai Crab.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.670
Shanghai Crab.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:43.150
It's very delicious.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:45.360
But it's difficult to cook.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:46.760
Really? Mao?

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.400
Shanghai Crab is really delicious,

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.080
but it's very small with little meat.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:53.690
Therefore for a chef,

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.570
Shanghai Crab is quite a test.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.390
Sure enough, it's Shanghai Crab.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.810
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:02.980
The theme of

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.840
Round 3

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:07.210
is Shanghai Crab.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.450
Then please open the crab gate.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.660
Look at the bright blue crab shells,

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:22.380
and glittering crab legs

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.590
with top notch freshness and taste.

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:25.270
As you can see,

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.550
they're authentic Shanghai crabs.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:34.510
It's too much.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.510
The woman picked up

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.450
all big and fat crabs.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.370
Lei En, come on.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:53.070
Why did he select all the little crabs?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.120
And the colors are so ugly.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.690
Isn't the Shanghai crab small enough?

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:59.460
Why did he choose the smaller ones?

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:00.390
Does it mean that

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.810
Lei En still can't pull himself together?

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.610
Don't worry, Meili.

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:05.360
But...

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:08.110
You see how clear and firm

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.070
Lei En's eyes are.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:11.700
Roger,

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.830
I don't expect you to forgive me.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.590
But I will bring happiness

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.380
to people as much as possible

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.400
with the Seven-Star Knives.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.310
This is my confession to you.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.700
Awesome.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.480
That's...

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:44.830
frying powder.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:45.840
I see.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.480
We'll win for sure this round.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.350
What are you talking about?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.990
Yeah, Lei En's cooking is...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.040
It's so irritating.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.180
Look at the woman.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.340
She doesn't do it quickly,

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:59.320
but just look at Lei En.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.560
What's she up to?

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.550
You just work hard.

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.980
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.780
Everyone, please look here.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.900
In the blink of an eye,

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.290
the crab shells

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.200
handled by Lei En

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.970
have already been piled up.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.230
Look at him.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.660
His knife skills are precise,

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:30.310
and exquisite.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.170
He's really a master.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.190
Lei En is really something!

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:38.840
It's too hard to figure it out.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.170
He used to be too serious

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.810
and always did things like that.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.970
He was unpredictable.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.240
He was too simple,

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:51.380
so...

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.210
But because of this,

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.900
when he wakes up...

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:08.950
That's great.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:11.740
This is the strength of Lei En,

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.150
a genius who once worked in Yang Spring Restaurant

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.290
and is skillful at the Dark Cooking.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.410
My knife skills

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.160
can't compare with his at all.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:20.890
It's a crab leg.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.140
I'll lick the rest of the meat inside.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.800
There's no meat left.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.300
The crab leg is so thin.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.630
But the inside was completely cleaned out.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.180
Besides the bold and resolute skills,

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:37.120
like the skill of Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop,

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:40.720
even with a small knife,

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.420
he can also do such delicate work.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.370
Lei En is really good.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:47.300
Looks like it's about to start.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.130
I wonder what dish Lei En is going to cook.

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.260
He chopped all the meat together.

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.180
Fry the meat with chopped scallion and ginger.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.380
Then stuffed it into the crab shell with the crab roe.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.960
What was drizzled on it?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.790
It's frying powder.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.320
Frying powder.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.300
I got it.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.010
Me too, Mao.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:31.810
I know why Lei En chose

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:34.060
the ugly small cabs.

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:35.640
What happened to you?

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.130
How did this happen?

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.730
How can you touch me?

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.790
Sorry, I didn't mean it.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.210
Give me one, too.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.010
Me too.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.560
Okay, no problem.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:48.990
One at a time.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:51.440
Presidents.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:52.760
Please drink as much as you can.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.780
Being a judge is actually very exhausting.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.860
We should enjoy such service.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.050
Turns out you are such a lovely woman.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:02.420
What's that woman doing?

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.620
How could she do that?

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:04.820
I'm so upset.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.560
No, not now.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.330
Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:13.660
just peeled the crab shells

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:15.510
and beat eggs.

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.460
She left everything behind

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.800
and went to serve the judges.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.610
Is she really confident of success?

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.270
What does she mean?

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.760
Lei En is all in.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.080
Is it possible that

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.160
the woman tries to buy off the judges?

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:32.250
How dare she insult the competition?

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.600
But then again,

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:37.090
the judges are really enviable.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.290
It's a shame.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.250
Win with cooking skills.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.240
It's too tricky.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:42.500
No.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.230
She isn't trying to insult the competition

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.010
or buying off the judges.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:47.440
A chef in the Dark Cooking Society

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.940
wouldn't have such a move.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:50.690
There must be a purpose.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.990
What the hell is that woman thinking?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.710
Okay, I should go.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.300
It's time to get back to cooking.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.240
What? It's over.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.690
Let's continue later.

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.460
But you must abide by

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:08.310
the two agreements I just mentioned

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:09.560
I know.

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.240
Two agreements?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.830
Here we go.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.490
She looks so sure of it.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.180
Let's see what she's got

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.890
and what kind of food will be cooked.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.570
All right. Xiang En

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.180
is ready to show her stuff.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.060
First, mix the crab meat

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.690
and the beaten eggs.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.750
What on earth will she make?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.210
Crab Meat Eggs.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.330
What's wrong with you guys?

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:56.980
She used so much good crab meat

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.180
just to make crab meat eggs.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.850
This is too much.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.630
Darn it!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.290
Isn't it a standing dish

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.160
that even a kid can cook?

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.980
Do you want to compete or not?

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.220
Don't you think that you could be arrogant

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.030
just because of your big boobs.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.590
OK.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.000
Create crab meat eggs.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.020
That's good.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.820
What the hell is wrong with them?

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:19.730
Thank you.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.420
Looks like

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:22.210
Xiang En is going to

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:23.520
cook the crab meat eggs.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.250
What kind of person is she?

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.440
The First Ordinary Chef

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:28.750
would polish her fingernails?

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.550
No, there must be something strange.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:31.950
What she cooks is absolutely not

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:34.040
the regular crab meat eggs.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.540
And she does not use

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.450
the Seven-Star Knives.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.810
Time's up.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.270
Please submit your dishes.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.020
(Lotus Crab)
What Xiang En cooked is Lotus Crab.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:52.300
(Lotus Crab)
Crab meat eggs.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.800
And then what Lei En did is...

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.310
This is...

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.570
the most advanced Shanghai cuisine,

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.440
Crab Bucket.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:02.300
(Crab Bucket)
Crab Shell Assorted Dish.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.400
No, it's not just any crab bucket.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.350
There is a layer outside,

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.620
which is golden and crispy.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.580
It looks really nice.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:12.870
I'm drooling.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.580
Which one we should eat first?

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:15.740
How about this?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.230
Let's start with Lei En's.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:18.330
Mr. Zhang.

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:20.770
Don't forget our first agreement.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:21.660
Agreement?

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.060
Would you please start with my dish?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.210
Well...

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:27.790
I almost forgot.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:29.470
What?

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:31.350
So that's the agreement.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.410
There is no difference

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:34.740
in eating Lei En's dish first or not.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:37.500
OK, let's start with Xiang En's crab meat eggs.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.300
Let me be clear, Xiang En.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.040
If you think you served us drinks

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.160
that we'll be partial to you,

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.460
then you're wrong.

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:45.930
The review still has to be fair and strict.

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:47.020
Of course.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.750
Think about it.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:50.620
Crab Meat Egg is kind of the representative

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.020
in the crab cuisine,

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.440
not to mention the crab meat egg

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:55.640
cooked by Xiang En who has dark technology.

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.130
I'm sure there's different

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:58.880
ingenuity in it.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:02.700
It's delicious.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.390
This is so delicious.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.430
It is nearly perfect.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.500
The heat is just right.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.970
Warm and soft stuff

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.780
and the fluffy and refreshing eggs

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.080
make it perfect.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.140
But anyhow,

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:20.710
it's just plain crab meat egg.

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:24.010
That is the so-called perfect

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.650
common crab meat egg.

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.190
Common crab meat egg.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.890
Seems the result is set.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.450
How could Lei En's Crab Bucket

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.830
lose to something like that?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:36.840
Please enjoy it.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:37.730
Please try

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.770
the crab soup.

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:41.970
It's not just crab meat eggs.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.610
Don't forget

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.360
the second agreement.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:50.140
Eat all the dishes.

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:50.870
Remember?

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.520
Yes, of course.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.140
Eat up

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.260
her dishes.

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.930
They will know how delicious Lei En's is.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:00.780
What a stupid agreement.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:02.650
Mao.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.620
Let's enjoy it.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:11.840
It worked.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.340
It's incredible.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.390
Crab meat egg and crab soup

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:19.920
are not so much

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.890
both in portion

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:23.320
but they bring

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.860
a strong sense of satisfaction

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:27.190
Next, we're going to eat Lei En's dish

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.480
Crab Bucket.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.810
It's been a long time.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:32.410
The crabs are different from other crabs.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.560
They're crabs shedding their skins.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:34.980
The highlight is

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:37.520
not about the delicacy of Shanghai Crab.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.500
What I do is to deliver

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.240
the taste of a whole crab.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.310
Crabs shedding skins.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.160
Right.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.080
No wonder they look so ugly.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.920
Plus, the shell of these crabs

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.230
are very soft.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.250
So after wrapped with the frying power and fried,

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.870
the whole crabs can be eaten.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.130
I see.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.700
That's why Lei En

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.940
chose small crabs.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.170
Exactly.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:05.190
This is a masterpiece of crab cooking.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.350
That is brilliant.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.010
You guys from the Dark Cooking Society,

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:13.210
you think you can beat us with crab eggs?

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:14.340
Two wins and one draw.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.990
We're going to win.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.940
No need to hold Round 4.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.940
Hand over the map and the code.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.300
Lei En is amazing.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:24.050
Mao.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:25.230
What's going on?

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:26.840
What's going on?

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.170
Why do I feel so upset?

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.630
Hey, Lei En.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:41.830
What?

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.990
Why does it taste so bad?

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.668 --> 00:23:19.471
I heard that Lei En's food tasted terrible,

00:23:19.471 --> 00:23:20.888
what the hell is going on here?

00:23:21.481 --> 00:23:24.880
Just as Xiang En's eyes glowed suspiciously in triumph,

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.710
something unusual happened to the Seven-Star knives.

00:23:27.451 --> 00:23:28.888
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.261 --> 00:23:32.192
Smash the Evil Blade! Soul of the Seven-Star Knives!

00:23:32.586 --> 00:23:33.947
It will definitely be interesting!
